    VS            & —    & 4.3  & 5.4  & 0.085 & 0.291 & +1.1  \\
    HB-Soft       & —    & 4.5  & 5.3  & 0.083 & —     & +0.8  \\
    IR-Soft       & —    & 4.0  & 4.8  & 0.078 & 0.270 & +0.8  \\
